# MathViz v2 — Interactive Mathematical Document Engine

A complete architectural pivot from "animation player" to **interactive mathematical document** — inspired by manim's object model, rendered with an editorial dark aesthetic, and usable from both web UI and CLI.

## What Changed From v1

| Aspect | v1 (current) | v2 (proposed) |
|--------|-------------|---------------|
| Paradigm | Animation player with timeline | Scrollable document with all steps visible |
| Matrix animations | Interpolates cell values (bad) | Objects transform/highlight/appear (manim-style) |
| Aesthetic | Modern glassmorphic, emoji icons | Editorial serif, minimal, no emojis |
| Scope | Linear algebra focused | General-purpose mathematics |
| AI Integration | JSON paste in web UI | CLI tool + programmatic API |
| Interactivity | Playback controls | Drag vectors, zoom graphs, click steps |

