## UI Design: Interactive Mathematical Document

### Layout

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  MathViz                      [Load] [Paste]    │
│  ─────                                          │
│                                                 │
│  ROW REDUCING TO RREF                           │
│  ═══════════════════                            │
│                                                 │
│  We have the augmented matrix [A|b]:            │
│                                                 │
│   ┌                        ┐                    │
│   │  2    1   −1  ┊  8     │                    │
│   │ −3   −1    2  ┊ −11    │                    │
│   │ −2    1    2  ┊ −3     │                    │
│   └                        ┘                    │
│                                                 │
│  ────────────────────────                       │
│                                                 │
│  Step 1:  R₁ → ½R₁                             │
│  Scale row 1 to make the leading entry 1.       │
│                                                 │
│   ┌                        ┐                    │
│   │  1   ½   −½  ┊  4     │  ← R₁ highlighted  │
│   │ −3   −1    2  ┊ −11    │                    │
│   │ −2    1    2  ┊ −3     │                    │
│   └                        ┘                    │
│                                                 │
│  ────────────────────────                       │
│                                                 │
│  Step 2:  R₂ → R₂ + 3R₁                        │
│  Eliminate the entry below the first pivot.      │
│                ⋮                                │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

### Key UI Principles
- **All steps visible** — scroll to see entireeprocess
- **Each step = narration + math + visual** in a single card
- **Interactive canvases** — vectors are draggable, graphs are zoomable
- **Animated transitions** — when a step scrolls into view, the animation plays (intersection observer)
- **Navigation** — thin minimal top bar, no sidebar clutter

### Aesthetic Tokens

| Token | Value | Usage |
|-------|-------|-------|
| Background | `#08090d` | Page background |
| Surface | `#0f1014` | Card background |
| Border | `rgba(180, 164, 124, 0.08)` | Subtle separators |
| Text Primary | `#d4cfc4` | Body text (warm off-white) |
| Text Muted | `#8a8478` | Secondary text |
| Accent Gold | `#b8a47c` | Highlights, links |
| Accent Teal | `#5a8a7a` | Pivots, success states |
| Accent Rose | `#a45a5a` | Errors, warnings |
| Heading Font | Crimson Pro, serif | Titles, narration |
| Body Font | Crimson Pro, serif | Body text |
| Mono Font | JetBrains Mono | Values, code, matrix cells |
| Radius | 3px | Minimal rounding |

