## Spec Format v2 (Scene-Based)

### Matrix RREF
```json
{
  "title": "Row Reducing an Augmented Matrix to RREF",
  "scene": [
    {
      "narration": "Consider the system of equations represented by the augmented matrix [A|b]:",
      "add": [
        { "type": "matrix", "id": "M", "values": [[2,1,-1,8],[-3,-1,2,-11],[-2,1,2,-3]], "augmented": 3 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "narration": "Scale row 1 to create a leading 1 in position (1,1).",
      "math": "R_1 \\to \\tfrac{1}{2} R_1",
      "animate": [
        { "type": "HighlightRow", "target": "M", "row": 0, "color": "accent" },
        { "type": "TransformMatrix", "target": "M", "values": [[1,0.5,-0.5,4],[-3,-1,2,-11],[-2,1,2,-3]], "changedRows": [0] }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

### 2D Vectors (Interactive)
```json
{
  "title": "Vector Addition in ℝ²",
  "scene": [
    {
      "narration": "Let v and w be two vectors in the plane.",
      "add": [
        { "type": "coordinateSystem", "id": "cs", "range": [-6, 6], "interactive": true },
        { "type": "vector", "id": "v", "components": [3, 1], "label": "v", "color": "#5a8a7a", "draggable": true },
        { "type": "vector", "id": "w", "components": [1, 3], "label": "w", "color": "#b8a47c", "draggable": true }
      ]
    },
    {
      "narration": "Their sum v + w is found by the parallelogram rule.",
      "math": "\\vec{v} + \\vec{w} = \\begin{bmatrix} 4 \\\\ 4 \\end{bmatrix}",
      "animate": [
        { "type": "GrowArrow", "id": "sum", "components": [4, 4], "label": "v + w", "color": "#a45a5a" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

### General Math: Quadratic Formula
```json
{
  "title": "Solving 2x² + 5x − 3 = 0",
  "scene": [
    {
      "narration": "Begin with the quadratic equation.",
      "add": [
        { "type": "equation", "id": "eq", "latex": "2x^2 + 5x - 3 = 0" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "narration": "Identify the coefficients a, b, and c.",
      "math": "a = 2, \\quad b = 5, \\quad c = -3"
    },
    {
      "narration": "Apply the quadratic formula.",
      "math": "x = \\frac{-b \\pm \\sqrt{b^2 - 4ac}}{2a} = \\frac{-5 \\pm \\sqrt{49}}{4}",
      "animate": [
        { "type": "Transform", "target": "eq", "latex": "x = \\frac{-5 \\pm 7}{4}" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "narration": "The two solutions are:",
      "math": "x = \\frac{1}{2} \\quad \\text{or} \\quad x = -3",
      "add": [
        { "type": "graph", "id": "g", "functions": [{"expr": "2*x^2 + 5*x - 3", "label": "f(x)"}], "points": [{"x": 0.5, "y": 0, "label": "x₁"}, {"x": -3, "y": 0, "label": "x₂"}], "xRange": [-5, 3], "yRange": [-7, 10] }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

